flowchart LR
  accTitle: Checkout architecture
  accDescr: Browsers reach the API gateway through Cloudflare. The gateway routes to the cart, payment and order services. The payment service, changed in this PR, charges cards through Stripe and sends a webhook to the order service. Orders are stored in Postgres, carts in Redis.
  browsers([Browsers]) --> cloudflare[Cloudflare]:::ext
  cloudflare --> gateway[API gateway]
  gateway --> cart[Cart service]
  gateway --> payment[Payment service]:::key
  gateway --> order[Order service]
  payment -->|charges cards| stripe[Stripe]:::ext
  payment -.->|webhook| order
  cart --> redis[(Redis)]
  order --> postgres[(Postgres)]
